<p>Infuse your weapon with overwhelming gravitational power while spinning around.</p><p>All creatures within radius 2 take <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">85%, 100%, 111%, 121%, 130%</acronym> weapon damage as physical (gravity) and are pulled closer.</p><p>Then, all adjacent creatures take <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">83%, 105%, 122%, 137%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage.  This second strike shields you for between <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">133, 179, 215, 246, 272</acronym> and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">267, 359, 431, 492, 545,</acronym> increasing with more enemies hit.  The shield lasts for 2 turns.</p><p>The shield strength will increase with your Spellpower.</p>